{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 2520,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# 概率不等式与集中界\n*Probability inequalities and concentration bounds*\n\n先读清 tail bound 的含义，再按已知信息选路：nonnegativity + mean 走 Markov；finite variance 走 Chebyshev；independence + boundedness 走 exponential bounds。随机量还是 event count 时，先到 [[指示变量与随机计数.canvas|indicator 建模]]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 先读结果\n\n[[尾界含义|尾界是保证，不是概率等号]]\n\n数值超过 1 时只剩平凡界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 再选工具\n\n[[概率界选择|写 target event、threshold 与条件]]\n\n没有满足 assumptions，就没有使用公式的资格。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 均值入口\n\n[[Markov不等式|Markov：非负 + mean 控制右尾]]\n\n证明来自逐点比较。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 支持集改进\n\n[[平移Markov界|shifted Markov：移除已知基线]]\n\n下界必须 almost surely 成立。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 二阶入口\n\n[[和的方差协方差项|variance of sum 要保留 covariance]]\n\npairwise uncorrelated 可逐项删交叉项；总和抵消也可能使方差相加。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 平方变换\n\n[[Chebyshev不等式|Chebyshev：对 squared deviation 用 Markov]]\n\nfinite variance 给双侧 polynomial tail。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Independence 边界\n\n[[两两独立不推出相互独立|pairwise 不推出 mutual]]\n\n二阶 covariance 与联合 MGF 需要的独立层级不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000009",
      "type": "text",
			"x": 1320,
			"y": 600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 指数入口\n\n[[指数Markov法|exponential Markov：优化 MGF 上界]]\n\n[[相互独立|Mutual independence]] 保证联合乘积分解；[[两两独立]]一般不够。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
			"x": 2020,
			"y": 600,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 相对偏差\n\n[[乘法Chernoff上界|multiplicative Chernoff]]\n\n独立 $[0,1]$ 变量和的 relative upper tail。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
			"x": 1320,
			"y": 900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 加性偏差\n\n[[Hoeffding不等式|general Hoeffding]]\n\n常数来自每个 support interval 的长度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
			"x": 2020,
			"y": 900,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 样本均值\n\n[[样本均值Hoeffding界|令 $t=n\\varepsilon$]]\n\n$[0,1]$ 时得到 $2e^{-2n\\varepsilon^2}$。"
    }
  ],
